OL,3,AWhite House denies Hegseth and Rubio to
OL,4,Aleave jobs after Republican election
OL,5,Alosses
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne outgoing congressional Republican
OL,8,Fhas threatened to force an impeachment
OL,9,Fvote against Hegseth as early as next
OL,10,Fweek. The defence secretary posted a
OL,11,Fvideo statement defending his record
OL,12,Fand denouncing the effort.
OL,14,F"You see, they attack me. They attack
OL,15,Fus because we are effective," he said.
OL,16,F"It's not going to work. We will not
OL,17,Fback down."
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
